#: src/gui/gaudit-task.c:15
msgid ""
"A firewall decides which connections from other computers may reach this "
"one. Having a firewall program installed is not enough: it also has to be "
"switched on. This check looks at the rules the system is using right now, "
"whichever program set them up.\n"
"\n"
"Reading the rules needs the administrator password, because only the "
"administrator may look at them. gAudit only reads the rules; it changes "
"nothing."
